  "task": "On Yosemite National Park’s Current Conditions page, count the active park alerts and report the first two, or all active alerts if fewer than two exist. Report the displayed Tioga Road status. Then open the park’s Entrance Reservations page and report whether a timed reservation is required to enter or drive through Yosemite in 2026.\n\nStopping condition: Stop after the active-alert count and titles, Tioga Road status, and 2026 entrance-reservation requirement have been recorded.\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not make a reservation or follow booking links.\n- Count active park alerts displayed by the National Park Service, not general notices elsewhere on the page.\n- Report the entrance or drive-through reservation policy, not campground, lodging, wilderness, or activity reservation requirements.\n- If fewer than two active alerts exist, report every active alert available.",
